  "comments": "<p><strong>NOTE:</strong></p><p>On Krause catalog (KM) are listed 1981 and 1989 issues; they don't exist.</p><p>1981 was added cause Colombian minthouse reports the amount of coins sent to Banco de la República on each year, but not by date on coins; therefore, the amount of coins listed on Krause for 1981 (65,219) are coins dated 1980. Amounts of previous years do not show the amounts by dates on coins, but the amount of coins sent on the listed year as reported by minthouse.</p><p>It exists &nbsp;a coin dated 1985, on PPH catalog (Pedro Pablo Hernandez) is listed as pattern, with mintage of 2000 units; on Krause is listed 138 units as 1989, but again it reflects the reported by minthouse.&nbsp;</p><p>1985 dated coins, possibly are a commemorative restrike, as it is not coherent to mint a pattern 11 years after first issue, and 5 years after last issue of the coin.</p><p>Dates 1985 and 1989 are not listed in this page, as are obvious mistakes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Variants:</strong></p><p>Small date KM#258.1, Large date KM#258.2</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/659ef6e36d41c.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/659ef6e36d41c.jpg\"></a><br><br>Small date KM#258.1 1974:<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5950ad06b0525.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5950ad06b0525.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5950ad0e11831.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5950ad0e11831.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>© Image courtesy of Global Coins (www.gcoins.net)</p>",
